renderer: the museum's wallhack, for recordings only

r_demo_xray draws players with the depth test off while a recording plays,
which is what the OpenGL wallhacks of 2000-2004 did: a wrapper opengl32.dll
that disabled GL_DEPTH_TEST when a player model drew. It shows exactly what
they showed — the players the server chose to send, the potentially visible
set, and no more — and it does nothing outside a recording, whatever the
cvar says. An exhibit for the cheats chapter.

